('0e6934cf-8b24-4abe-8a10-387de4c0e76a', null, 'public_demo', 8, '## Data model

The database has five main tables: workspaces, members, notes, decisions and action items. A decision links to the note it came from, the people involved and a date. An action item links to a note, an owner and a due date. Deleting a note marks its decisions as "source removed" instead of deleting them, so the decision history is never silently lost.', '[-0.041494,0.004687,0.017848,-0.014909,-0.010699,-0.013614,0.012947,0.01663,0.065711,-0.002712,0.063025,0.066728,-0.011002,-0.008561,-0.029052,-0.049329,-0.042396,-0.002028,0.032373,0.02539,0.028737,-0.012886,-0.02823,0.006453,0.063406,0.068432,0.031707,-0.046102,-0.056493,-0.202522,-0.022638,0.018208,0.041141,-0.017334,0.010115,-0.014088,0.01169,0.010172,-0.060448,0.025458,0.05878,0.036968,0.041191,0.007886,0.021096,-0.016639,0.017984,-0.027893,0.026082,-0.014914,-0.01188,-0.033365,-0.108025,0.061297,0.032754,-0.000704,0.122449,0.056286,0.009252,0.020738,0.023949,-0.008248,-0.143323,0.083541,-0.031539,0.033935,0.020725,-0.037234,-0.026328,0.035672,-0.041869,0.007462,-0.046016,0.008373,0.017719,-0.049286,-0.022227,-0.011729,0.017943,-0.028352,-0.045998,-0.051633,-0.00096,0.003033,-0.001547,-0.007032,-0.054287,-0.021257,-0.03416,-0.008964,0.03106,0.003886,0.035294,0.053348,-0.049297,-0.008429,-0.015579,0.010161,-0.04178,0.380868,-0.070886,0.029211,0.025557,0.009829,-0.036147,-0.043139,0.006681,-0.090532,-0.007575,0.027963,0.013701,0.019894,0.009546,-0.031939,0.010722,-0.012165,0.025419,0.023501,0.006045,-0.02907,-0.037577,0.014058,0.071407,0.070203,0.033671,0.0079,0.022912,0.063023,0.05682,0.012178,0.029506,-0.024372,-0.056884,-0.036985,0.016015,-0.007216,0.079499,-0.040228,-0.023092,-0.045446,-0.013777,0.026719,0.034212,-0.035868,-0.086148,0.167301,0.006632,-0.005195,-0.004884,0.027714,-0.00927,0.098658,0.059383,0.025766,-0.005394,0.070454,-0.0083,-0.030228,-0.064096,0.010321,-0.005845,-0.031349,-0.016981,0.08319,-0.040721,-0.078958,-0.03847,0.01873,0.023712,0.012733,0.023786,0.001567,-0.059368,0.031059,0.052041,-0.0