('c7397bbb-05e6-4772-8f19-43c3394cd5a1', null, 'public_demo', 7, '## Customer feedback summary

Tom summarised feedback from the 12 teams that tried the early prototype:

- Ten teams liked the plain-language search and described it as "the part that feels like magic".
- Seven teams wanted a calendar integration, which is why the decision to postpone it was discussed at length.
- Five teams found the extracted decisions too detailed, and asked for shorter summaries.
- Three teams asked for a way to export all notes, which is already planned.', '[-0.072401,0.022156,-0.003335,-0.013351,-0.053716,0.024193,-0.066888,0.045709,0.017179,-0.028609,0.038377,0.054365,0.005782,-0.028001,-0.035997,-0.059305,-0.030084,-0.126269,0.020161,0.011173,0.006573,-0.008133,0.006199,0.019383,0.042532,0.000223,-0.028543,-0.084313,-0.04298,-0.183145,-0.036418,0.026622,0.057275,-0.005727,0.02113,0.034317,0.006223,0.001636,-0.002839,0.036877,0.008975,0.03895,-0.018728,0.010085,0.034364,-0.056755,0.014957,-0.019676,-0.025216,0.031669,0.031635,-0.045523,-0.013455,0.01411,-0.008314,0.086262,-0.013627,0.05713,0.027002,0.007202,0.046937,-0.021661,-0.137879,0.082428,-0.014928,0.060598,-0.059309,-0.036258,-0.042131,0.069847,-0.025214,0.049454,0.000813,0.019855,-0.000018,0.034474,-0.001223,-0.003822,0.009049,-0.037587,-0.045029,-0.006762,-0.051539,-0.012157,-0.018303,-0.037838,0.009085,0.056936,0.032001,-0.007728,0.067084,-0.001753,-0.005809,0.023346,-0.067727,-0.036634,0.002457,-0.045791,-0.042899,0.446873,0.00496,0.057993,0.043548,0.022769,-0.031478,-0.024582,0.050594,-0.082946,0.018146,0.002434,0.000986,0.033844,0.047287,-0.045491,0.013912,0.020832,-0.000056,-0.028064,0.000059,-0.031248,0.017593,0.029271,0.05645,0.00865,0.003002,0.037841,0.042816,0.016931,-0.002248,0.044369,0.047509,-0.021976,-0.039518,-0.011875,0.015841,-0.008598,-0.006444,-0.078121,0.038238,0.037218,0.004845,-0.006982,0.041196,-0.069268,-0.040676,0.141308,0.008366,-0.028038,0.01541,0.038746,0.021152,0.07522,0.029091,-0.022862,-0.016845,0.034029,0.027815,0.047505,-0.066788,0.059497,0.013896,0.005975,-0.011343,0.059888,0.009651,-0.106522,-0.044913,0.006594,0.018599,-0.014778,-0.031051,-0.015636,-0.00915,0.021891,0.039037,0.027601,0.0017,-0.028087,0.055858,0.028943,0.026498,0.019088,0.015264,0.023511,-0.045753,-0.007593,-0.036883,-0.035175,-0.033163,0.013157,-0.087798,-0.059271,0.000275,0.125939,-0.048457,-0.037597,0.018179,-0.040003,-0.047565,0.008609,0.001591,-0.045533,-0.031364,0.050463,0.0