('57e6fc7d-e9b2-4d6d-937f-d20b7c20f6f3', null, 'public_demo', 8, '## Customer research findings

We interviewed 24 project leads between March and May. Nineteen of them said they lose track of decisions at least once a month. Fourteen said the biggest cost is repeating a discussion that already happened. Only six use any dedicated tool for notes; most rely on shared documents and chat history.

When asked what would make them switch, the most common answer was "search that actually finds the thing I half remember". The second most common was "no extra work after the meeting".', '[0.000363,0.016623,0.021979,-0.017864,-0.017151,-0.019539,0.003649,0.018948,0.027158,-0.040612,0.05767,0.10199,0.009696,-0.028253,-0.00659,0.002928,-0.01527,-0.092713,0.052955,0.032139,0.011212,-0.024899,-0.019249,0.029511,0.012617,0.022438,-0.012584,-0.096401,-0.05002,-0.161289,-0.019829,0.001293,0.070394,0.011653,0.007146,0.038845,0.016649,0.015161,0.001207,0.018513,-0.003833,-0.027591,0.001874,0.00241,-0.035887,-0.010383,0.003751,-0.061714,0.005137,0.019678,0.005121,-0.04271,-0.00861,0.030136,-0.013237,0.029507,0.034146,0.005696,-0.001969,-0.018958,0.03131,-0.075541,-0.189904,0.013414,-0.042111,0.053332,-0.050284,-0.046096,-0.063731,0.061144,-0.002403,0.025497,-0.05416,0.012299,0.062602,0.011311,-0.040302,-0.02388,0.050259,-0.050441,-0.027112,0.027067,-0.01851,0.003292,0.01651,-0.076833,0.033001,0.037022,0.03464,-0.022255,0.071803,-0.027773,-0.025376,0.00931,-0.043246,-0.009672,0.018878,0.009305,-0.063433,0.417839,-0.046092,0.045125,0.00002,0.016709,-0.047157,-0.051834,0.018863,-0.032586,0.019056,0.034737,0.017651,0.026327,0.001724,-0.093415,0.029315,0.037573,0.006495,-0.00474,0.010004,0.018125,-0.041688,0.021446,0.080371,0.016824,-0.057087,0.046355,0.019759,0.03942,-0.004219,-0.045255,0.077117,-0.011243,-0.130712,0.035004,-0.028407,0.0132,0.066206,-0.025641,0.024463,0.027074,0.026364,0.035745,0.054773,-0.043289,-0.065656,0.178413,0.038453,0.009242,0.013478,-0.031324,-0.016264,0.063606,0.008505,-0.033513,0.038364,0.008267,0.037275,0.013129,-0.038086,0.024227,0.015079,0.005423,-0.031583,0.048372,0.05496,-0.102126,-0.010513,0.035621,0.026519,-0.020054,0.00042,0.015325,0.02743,-0.024123,0.001442,-0.03273,-0.017427,-0.011898,0.011577,0.025045,0.044567,0.086503,-0.021994,0.045416,-0.03505,-0.034157,-0.012286,-0.001121,0.00044,-0.000171,-0.045252,-0.044604,0.039801,0.096242,-0.049688,