('57e6fc7d-e9b2-4d6d-937f-d20b7c20f6f3', null, 'public_demo', 9, '## Competitive landscape

The main alternatives are general-purpose document tools and chat-based note bots. General-purpose tools are flexible but have weak search for decisions. Chat-based bots capture text but do not organise it. Orbit Notes focuses on one job: making past decisions easy to find and trust.

Competitor team plans range from 5 to 10 dollars per member per month, which is why the price is set at 8 dollars.', '[-0.066768,0.005628,-0.001274,-0.013926,-0.035221,-0.013348,-0.020756,0.033008,-0.013881,0.01216,0.028737,0.084395,0.034388,0.007674,-0.048031,-0.087951,-0.007264,-0.032961,0.10039,0.062365,0.030186,-0.028648,-0.022898,-0.011017,0.025659,0.068465,-0.077645,-0.04297,-0.039706,-0.151577,0.025727,0.012564,0.024549,0.002975,-0.059641,0.047897,0.007388,-0.040306,-0.01175,0.022848,0.031381,0.030863,-0.053502,0.020778,-0.003684,-0.060746,-0.016529,-0.019039,-0.052301,0.008665,0.007954,-0.013953,0.005684,0.021749,-0.018024,0.007046,0.037485,-0.000165,-0.016236,-0.018915,0.001029,-0.031081,-0.142123,0.092702,-0.064439,0.031365,-0.023553,0.048123,-0.03635,0.051664,0.012446,0.02767,-0.036451,0.013887,0.021383,0.007146,-0.080264,-0.021599,0.039931,-0.024446,-0.04336,-0.036321,-0.054687,0.042783,-0.003246,-0.036584,0.046786,0.017368,0.0257,-0.004828,0.072497,0.019562,0.027101,-0.011517,0.006625,-0.003566,0.010575,0.001508,-0.066192,0.413832,-0.025733,0.025591,0.012136,-0.008147,0.014535,-0.075189,0.027809,-0.038616,-0.023707,0.049131,0.006527,0.008488,0.002669,-0.034494,-0.035797,-0.022432,0.034754,-0.036471,0.049119,0.01025,-0.050742,-0.005475,0.029951,0.05997,-0.001099,0.064957,0.018211,0.061351,0.01704,0.018771,0.09745,-0.025963,-0.077336,0.025348,0.05047,-0.001066,0.013595,-0.045827,-0.024685,0.044963,0.004112,-0.002686,0.056161,-0.027309,-0.041393,0.128854,0.050991,0.034052,-0.024169,-0.009614,-0.001847,0.018928,0.052997,0.009517,-0.028644,0.00681,0.031584,0.006896,-0.081603,0.008094,-0.041348,0.040319,-0.059002,0.114158,0.044195,-0.145131,-0.034068,-0.021132,-0.000859,0.002524,-0.001561,-0.052289,0.043041,-0.001474,0.080375,-0.007834,-0.064073,-0.017271,0.014429,0.033421,0.044163,0.016878,-0.037329,-0.007072,-0.047573,0.000282,-0.037241,0.002832,0.051697,-0.023576,-0.055048,0.010894,0.002258,0.091425,-0.049631,0.013886,-0.036262,-0.068741,-0.060921,-0.01180