('57e6fc7d-e9b2-4d6d-937f-d20b7c20f6f3', null, 'public_demo', 10, '## Success metrics

The team will judge the MVP on four measures:

- At least 60 percent of beta teams still active after 8 weeks.
- Median time to find a past decision under 60 seconds.
- Decision extraction accepted without edits at least 85 percent of the time.
- At least 30 percent of workspaces invite 5 or more members in the first month.', '[-0.071947,-0.002201,-0.010072,-0.050869,-0.043242,0.034571,0.049166,0.014655,0.039063,0.046663,0.030453,0.030673,-0.005978,0.018892,-0.052334,-0.012282,-0.027539,-0.054503,0.014944,0.012484,-0.004118,-0.040256,-0.005655,0.020716,0.077998,0.049374,-0.026356,-0.051375,-0.088761,-0.186037,-0.073667,-0.063998,0.11296,-0.003484,-0.041526,0.051409,-0.006443,-0.003724,-0.004995,-0.007089,0.060422,0.018383,-0.007042,-0.004782,-0.041656,0.013004,0.005266,-0.054174,0.007545,0.06066,0.015421,-0.027416,0.034871,0.07596,0.01298,0.011048,0.038005,0.04027,0.040323,-0.048098,0.032902,-0.023908,-0.145816,0.026584,-0.041146,0.022459,-0.055516,-0.091041,-0.046264,0.01762,0.039677,0.062181,0.005981,-0.009831,0.037773,0.060395,0.015451,-0.002263,0.047745,-0.011414,-0.034026,0.018301,-0.034098,-0.03464,0.013731,0.007213,0.048769,0.065674,0.040645,0.050459,0.015862,0.023106,-0.057701,0.022224,-0.029136,-0.026484,-0.008056,-0.045435,-0.029857,0.356804,-0.072728,0.086681,-0.056162,-0.001294,0.025012,-0.063583,0.043753,0.03903,-0.006077,0.064256,-0.021274,0.021274,0.063887,-0.034856,-0.008819,0.081223,-0.06508,0.027433,0.00647,-0.073413,-0.014209,0.055421,0.08568,-0.018586,-0.037557,0.082249,0.087486,0.06433,0.035447,0.037557,0.080639,0.027733,-0.093692,-0.012648,0.000773,0.007776,0.033352,0.017012,-0.028131,-0.030777,0.045617,0.011757,0.109111,-0.064584,-0.04501,0.133918,-0.058681,-0.003113,0.014258,-0.042126,-0.045451,0.056546,-0.024473,-0.024187,-0.003111,0.014894,0.008495,-0.022496,-0.070912,0.033253,-0.063948,0.014416,-0.012843,0.040478,0.016025,-0.014282,0.008238,-0.030487,0.030787,0.023051,0.017889,-0.020387,0.022847,-0.001594,0.038089,-0.000429,0.011873,-0.021597,0.006618,-0.026513,0.083843,0.003787,-0.016445,0.043068,0.041284,0.01826,0.016067,-0.085961,0.039185,0.033284,-0.05841,-0.025884,-0.075661,0.061569,0.045473,-0.025586,-0.006102,-0.054518,-0.036304,0.024544,-0.053272,-0.042068,0.020462,0.0064